        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-30T06:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can call pm. It probably just sends an IPC to the system server, and this code runs way before system server starts.",
      "parentUuid": "480b65eb_27786ec6",
      "revId": "ffa66ad4bf2f9a76a9a96d9f290e55b9c5bcd305",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
