      "writtenOn": "2024-05-30T07:30:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003eUnfortunately there doesn\u0027t seem to be any good system property we can check to differentiate phone/tablet vs watch/wear vs auto vs tv... so the best we appear to be able to do is something like this.\n\nTechnically for TV devices, they have to configure `ro.oem.key1`: https://docs.partner.android.com/tv/requirements/gtvs/android-14#a14-rooemkey1-usage",
